# Taifoon

Read `skills/taifoon/SKILL.md` first: it routes to the task skill, decides free / free key / paid, and explains the answers
(409 already_registered, 401, 402 with an x402 quote, 403 role_denies, 429).

- HTTP: `https://coord.taifoon.dev/v1` (search operations: `/v1/ops/search?q=<words>`)
- MCP: add `{"mcpServers":{"taifoon":{"url":"https://coord.taifoon.dev/mcp"}}}` to `.cursor/mcp.json`
- Keys go in the `x-api-key` header, never in a URL, a log or a commit.
